# Ad Nauseam: the life lost is the revealed card's mana value as it is in the library. A split card not on the stack has
# the combined mana value of its halves (CR 202.3d: Life // Death is 1 + 2 = 3) and an X in a mana cost is 0 outside the
# stack (CR 202.3e, 107.3g: Mind Twist is {X}{B}, so 1). Bot1 takes both, 4 life in all, and then declines.

